{"id":"788f4256d9b974d6","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-binary-operation.md","title":"Binary Operation","display":"df-binary-operation — Binary Operation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-binary-operation","aliases":["58-df-binary-operation","Binary Operation"],"display":"df-binary-operation — Binary Operation","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-binary-operation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-binary-operation</span><span>Binary Operation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-binary-operation — Binary Operation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in V\">\\(S\\in V\\)</span>（集合，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star\\in V\">\\(\\star\\in V\\)</span>（函数图候选）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,S\\times S,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,S\\times S,S)\\)</span>（函数谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinOp}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{BinOp}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary-operation} \\vdash \\mathrm{BinOp}_S(\\star,S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,S\\times S,S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary-operation} \\vdash \\mathrm{BinOp}_S(\\star,S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,S\\times S,S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Binary operation: combining two elements to produce a third in same set</li>\n<li>Group: operation with identity and inverses (all elements); ring adds second operation</li>\n<li>Semigroup: associative; monoid: semigroup with identity; magma: no axioms</li>\n<li>Universal algebra studies general <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-ary operations with identities</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Herstein, Abstract Algebra</li>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c3